            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "Under heavy daily desk use, roughly two to four years is a realistic estimate. With lighter use, such as a walk most evenings, and regular lubrication, many pads last longer. A neglected pad worked for hours every day may not reach two years. Hours of use and care matter more than brand or price.",
          },
        },
        {
